    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46426" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suffītus</span></b> ,
			ūs, m.
		suffio. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A fumigating</i>, <i>fumigation</i>
			(Plinian): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suffitu necare cimices,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 10, 42, § 142</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">37, 10, 54,
				§ 142</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crebrior,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					22, 23, 48, § 100</span></i>
			.— <i>Plur.</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 24,
				11, 61, § 102</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In concr., <i>the smoke
				produced by fumigation</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herbae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					21, 18, 69, § 116</span></i>
			. </div>
